  ],
  "note": "KDE Plasma defaults. KDE's Meta key is written Win. The Alt+D chords are two-step sequences, so they are recorded as type \"sequence\". Left out: the bare Meta key (Application Launcher), because a modifier alone is not a chord; and \"Peek at Desktop\", which the Plasma Desktop page gives the same Ctrl+F12 binding the Fundamentals page calls \"Show Desktop\". The Plasma Desktop shortcuts page labels Meta+= as Zoom out and Meta+- as Zoom in, which contradicts the Fundamentals page; the Fundamentals wording (Meta+= Zoom In) is used here. Spectacle screenshot and Klipper clipboard defaults are not listed in the KDE documentation pages above, so they are not included.",
